{"id":58,"date":"2026-03-24T14:56:41","date_gmt":"2026-03-24T14:56:41","guid":{"rendered":""},"modified":"2026-03-24T15:17:35","modified_gmt":"2026-03-24T15:17:35","slug":"editor-top-picks","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"http:\/\/psychic-review-directorycom.local\/editor-top-picks\/","title":{"rendered":"Editor&#8217;s Top Picks"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<div class=\"wp-block-group page-body\"><div class=\"wp-block-group__inner-container is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/03\/editor-picks.png\" alt=\"Editor picks awards\"\/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n\n\n<p>Hand-selected by our editorial team after months of testing. These are the platforms and readers we recommend most highly right now.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Best Overall: Kasamba<\/h2>\n\n\n<p>Kasamba continues to lead our rankings with the largest selection of verified readers, consistent accuracy in our test sessions, and the most generous new-user offer in the industry. Their 24\/7 availability and multi-channel support (chat, phone, email) make it the most versatile platform for any type of reading.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Best for Beginners: Keen<\/h2>\n\n\n<p>Keen&#8217;s intuitive interface, detailed reader profiles, and low introductory pricing make it the ideal starting point for anyone new to online psychic readings. Their filter system helps you narrow down hundreds of readers to find exactly the right match.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Best for Video Readings: Purple Garden<\/h2>\n\n\n<p>If face-to-face connection matters to you, Purple Garden&#8217;s video reading experience is unmatched. Smooth streaming, a clean mobile app, and transparent pricing make it the top choice for video sessions.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Best for Love Readings: Psychic Source<\/h2>\n\n\n<p>Psychic Source has cul